  "_readme": [
    "Places our buyer is standing when they need look 197: a dark room, a phone that cannot hold it.",
    "",
    "kind=district is a pin over a cluster of venues. Meta's smallest radius is about 1km and the",
    "Victoria Island clubs sit inside one of those circles, so pinning each club separately would",
    "buy the same people several times over. kind=venue is only used where a place sits away from",
    "any cluster and would otherwise be missed.",
    "",
    "'search' is what to type into Meta's location box. It geocodes as you type, which is the check",
    "on every address below — if a pin lands in the wrong country it shows up there, not here.",
    "nights: 1=Mon ... 7=Sun. Empty means every night the ad set runs."
  ],
